# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository (and on checkout).
# This repo is developed on Windows, but Python, YAML, Markdown, modern
# PowerShell, VS Code, and git all handle LF cleanly — and storing a single
# line ending stops the CRLF/LF churn that otherwise floods diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types: never normalize (would corrupt them).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
